==French==

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/tu.ʃe/}}, {{SAMPA|/tu.Se/}}

===Etymology===
From {{Ger.|fr}} {{term|tukkar}}.

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# The act of [[touching]] {{i|cfr. infra}}.
# A way of touching.
# The [[sensorial function]] [[touch]].

===Verb===
{{infl|fr|verb}}

# {{transitive|lang=fr}} To [[touch]] physically.
#:''me '''touches''' pas!''
#::''Don't touch me!''
# {{transitive|lang=fr}} To [[move]] emotionally
# {{transitive|lang=fr}} To [[try out]].
#:''Je n'ai jamais '''touché''' le tabac''
#::''I've never tried tobacco''

